" end="01:36.038">talk</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.038" end="01:43.872"><span begin="01:36.038" end="01:36.449">And </span><span begin="01:36.449" end="01:37.738">you </span><span begin="01:37.738" end="01:38.041">know </span><span begin="01:38.041" end="01:39.529">we </span><span begin="01:39.529" end="01:39.825">can </span><span begin="01:39.825" end="01:41.746">be </span><span begin="01:41.746" end="01:41.949">just </span><span begin="01:41.949" end="01:42.139">what </span><span begin="01:42.139" end="01:42.371">they </span><span begin="01:42.371" end="01:43.872">want</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.584" end="01:47.907"><span begin="01:44.584" end="01:44.800">'Cause </span><span begin="01:44.800" end="01:45.027">I've </span><span begin="01:45.027" end="01:45.161">been </span><span begin="01:45.161" end="01:45.403">out </span><span begin="01:45.403" end="01:45.786">until </span><span begin="01:45.786" end="01:46.124">the </span><span begin="01:46.124" end="01:47.907">morning</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.907" end="01:51.406"><span begin="01:47.907" end="01:48.123">And </span><span begin="01:48.123" end="01:48.323">I </span><span begin="01:48.323" end="01:48.562">don't </span><span begin="01:48.562" end="01:48.866">think </span><span begin="01:48.866" end="01:49.114">I'll </span><span begin="01:49.114" end="01:49.346">last </span><span begin="01:49.346" end="01:50.162">another </span><span begin="01:50.162" end="01:51.406">night</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.406" end="01:54.807"><span begin="01:51.406" end="01:51.607">I </span><span begin="01:51.607" end="01:51.798">knew </span><span begin="01:51.798" end="01:52.023">the </span><span begin="01:52.023" end="01:52.407">feeling </span><span begin="01:52.407" end="01:52.654">would </span><span begin="01:52.654" end="01:52.894">be </span><span begin="01:52.894" end="01:54.807">forming</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.807" end="01:58.328"><span begin="01:54.807" end="01